#. module: tk_website_rental_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:tk_website_rental_management.landlord_enquiry_notification_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>Dear <strong t-esc=\"object.property_id.landlord_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>We are pleased to inform you that a potential tenant has submitted an inquiry regarding your property, <strong t-esc=\"object.property_id.name\"/>. Below are the details of the inquiry:</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <h4>Inquiry Details:</h4>\n"
"\n"
"                <strong>Name:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.contact_name\"/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <strong>Email:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.email_from\"/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <strong>Phone:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.mobile\"/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <strong>Message:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.description\"/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <strong>Inquiry Date:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.create_date\" t-options=\"{ 'format': 'MM/dd/YYYY' }\"/>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Please reach out to the interested party at your earliest convenience to discuss further details or schedule a property viewing.</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to contact us at <strong><a t-attf-href=\"tel://{{ object.company_id.phone }}\" t-esc=\"object.company_id.phone\"/></strong>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>Thank you for using <strong t-esc=\"object.company_id.name\"/> to manage your property. We look forward to helping you secure a tenant soon!</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <h4>\n"
"                    Best regards\n"
"                </h4>\n"
"                <h5>\n"
"                    <strong>\n"
"                        <t t-esc=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </strong>\n"
"                </h5>\n"
"                <hr/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <h4>\n"
"                        <t t-esc=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </h4>\n"
"                    <t t-esc=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-esc=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-esc=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<p>亲爱的 <strong t-esc=\"object.property_id.landlord_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>我们很高兴地通知您，一位潜在租户已提交了有关您房产的询问， <strong t-esc=\"object.property_id.name\"/>。以下是询价详情：</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <h4>询问详情：</h4>\n"
"\n"
"                <strong>姓名：</strong> <span t-field=\"object.contact_name\"/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <strong>电子邮件：</strong> <span t-field=\"object.email_from\"/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <strong>电话：</strong> <span t-field=\"object.mobile\"/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <strong>信息：</strong> <span t-field=\"object.description\"/>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <strong>询价日期：</strong> <span t-field=\"object.create_date\" t-options=\"{ 'format': 'MM/dd/YYYY' }\"/>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>请尽快联系感兴趣的方，讨论进一步的细节或安排查看房产。</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>如果您有任何疑问或需要帮助，请随时联系我们<strong><a t-attf-href=\"tel://{{ object.company_id.phone }}\" t-esc=\"object.company_id.phone\"/></strong>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>感谢您使用<strong t-esc=\"object.company_id.name\"/> 管理您的房产。我们期待尽快帮助您找到租客！</p>\n"
